  { day: 10, title: 'Bwindi to Lake Mburo and Entebbe', body: 'After breakfast drive north via Kabale to Lake Mburo National Park. Afternoon game drive or boat ride for zebras, hippos, topis and impalas. Continue to Kampala and Entebbe. Arrive late evening. End of safari.' },
